# Monitor Dunes: the Dumps, track 2 (SPEC 3.2). The landfill's dune sea:
# long flowing bends over swells of crushed CRT glass (hill runs), down
# the east side, then the bottom straight where the Sweeper crosses (a
# maintenance crawler shuttling between gates in the walls; a crossing
# deals 60 and a shove: go behind it), and back up through the inner
# dunes. A service bay down the west side's left lane.
# Control point 0 is the start line; features on point i apply to the
# segment from point i to i+1; a segment without `open` has walls.
league dumps
width 60
# x    y    half   features
 240  130   62                     # start line, heading east
 480  125   62     crates          # top straight: four crates
 710  150   60
 870  240   58     hill            # the east dunes
 900  400   58     hill
 840  560   58
 900  720   58
 820  860   60
 620  860   62     sweeper         # bottom straight west: the Sweeper's lane
 420  860   62     crates
 240  840   58     hill            # the inner dunes
 150  710   56     hill
 270  600   56
 520  610   56
 650  480   56     crates
 560  330   56
 380  330   56
 250  420   58     bay:left        # west side: the service bay lane
 125  320   58
 140  190   60
